<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Preview BAST - ICT Universitas</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        primary: '#e62129', // --red-500
                        border: '#d9d9d9',  // --gray-400
                        foreground: '#262626', // --gray-800
                        muted: '#f5f5f5', // --gray-200
                        'muted-foreground': '#8c8c8c', // --gray-600
                        'navbar-gradient-end': '#ffeced'
                    },
                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Poppins', 'sans-serif'] }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        /* Typography - Berdasarkan typography.tsx */
        .text-h4 { font-family: 'Poppins'; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 38px; }
        .text-h6 { font-family: 'Poppins'; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 28px; }
        .text-body-small { font-family: 'Poppins'; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 22px; }
        .text-body-small-bold { font-family: 'Poppins'; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 22px; }
        .text-caption-bold { font-family: 'Poppins'; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 20px; }
        .text-pixie { font-family: 'Poppins'; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 12px; }

        @media print { 
            .no-print { display: none !important; }
            body { background: white !important; padding: 0 !important; }
            .print-border-none { border: none !important; box-shadow: none !important; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#fafafa] font-sans text-foreground p-6 md:p-10">

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center mb-6 no-print">
        <a href="/" class="h-10 px-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border bg-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-muted transition-all">
            &larr; Kembali
        </a>
        <button onclick="window.print()" class="h-10 px-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-[#ca161c] transition-all shadow-md">
            Cetak BAST (PDF)
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white p-12 border border-border rounded-xl print-border-none shadow-sm">
        
        <div class="text-center border-b-2 border-primary pb-6 mb-8">
            <h1 class="text-h4 text-primary uppercase">ICT Universitas</h1>
            <p class="text-caption-bold text-muted-foreground tracking-[0.2em] mt-1">BERITA ACARA SERAH TERIMA INVENTARIS</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-h6 mb-4">Informasi Penerima</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-y-2 text-body-small">
                <div class="text-muted-foreground font-bold uppercase text-[10px]">Nama Lengkap</div>
                <div class="font-semibold">: <%= user.nama %></div>
                
                <div class="text-muted-foreground font-bold uppercase text-[10px]">NIP</div>
                <div class="font-semibold">: <%= user.nip %></div>

                <div class="text-muted-foreground font-bold uppercase text-[10px]">Tanggal</div>
                <div class="font-semibold">: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('id-ID', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-h6 mb-4">Detail Perangkat</h2>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-border overflow-hidden">
                <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
                    <thead class="bg-muted border-b border-border">
                        <tr class="text-caption-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase">
                            <th class="px-6 py-3">Status Aset</th>
                            <th class="px-6 py-3">Model / Deskripsi</th>
                            <th class="px-6 py-3 text-center">Serial Number</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="text-body-small divide-y divide-border">
                        <tr>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4">
                                <span class="inline-flex px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-red-50 text-primary text-[10px] font-bold uppercase">Laptop Baru</span>
                            </td>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-foreground">Unit Inventaris Universitas</td>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center font-mono font-bold text-primary tracking-wider"><%= user.sn_baru %></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="bg-muted/30 text-muted-foreground">
                            <td class="px-6 py-4 italic">Laptop Lama (Return)</td>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4 italic"><%= user.model_lama %></td>
                            <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center font-mono italic uppercase"><%= user.sn_lama %></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10 pt-4 border-t border-dashed border-border">
            <h2 class="text-h6 mb-4">Kelengkapan Perangkat</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg bg-white border border-border shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded border-[1.5px] border-primary bg-primary">
                        <svg class="h-3 w-3 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4">
                            <path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-body-small-bold leading-tight font-bold">Charger Adapter</p>
                        <p class="text-pixie text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider">Kondisi: Lengkap & Berfungsi</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg bg-white border border-border shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded border-[1.5px] border-primary bg-primary">
                        <svg class="h-3 w-3 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4">
                            <path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-body-small-bold leading-tight font-bold">Tas Laptop</p>
                        <p class="text-pixie text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider">Kondisi: Sleeve Universitas</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#fafbee] p-5 rounded-lg border border-[#c2d43d]/30 mb-10">
            <p class="text-body-small italic text-[#5b6416] leading-relaxed">
                "Saya menyatakan telah menerima perangkat beserta kelengkapannya dalam kondisi baik. Saya bertanggung jawab penuh atas penggunaan dan pemeliharaan aset sesuai kebijakan TI Universitas."
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex justify-end">
            <div class="text-center w-64">
                <p class="text-caption-bold text-muted-foreground uppercase mb-2">Pihak Penerima,</p>
                <div class="h-24 flex items-center justify-center relative border border-dashed border-border rounded-lg mb-2">
                    <span class="absolute text-[32px] font-black text-gray-100 uppercase -rotate-12 select-none">VERIFIED</span>
                    <img src="<%= user.signature %>" alt="TTD" class="relative z-10 h-20 grayscale brightness-90">
                </div>
                <p class="text-body-small font-bold border-t border-foreground pt-1">( <%= user.nama %> )</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground uppercase mt-1">NIP: <%= user.nip %></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-20 text-center border-t border-border pt-4">
            <p class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">Dokumen Inventaris Sah - ICT Universitas Division</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>